# --------------------------------------------------------------------- results
# The slice caches are a derived artifact (6.4 GB for the full cohort alone) and
# rebuild from the dataset in minutes. Checkpoints are ~70 MB per full run;
# attach them to a GitHub Release or use Git LFS rather than committing them.
results/cache/
results/checkpoints/

# Metrics ARE kept: they are small CSVs and they are the evidence for every
# number in README.md and BUGS.md.
!results/metrics/

